From 7c2b91207f8ed2a8c0e64315e670411d553c552a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: utzcoz <utzcoz@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:59:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] vr: scope OpenXR CFI exemptions to runtime dispatch

Route OpenXR extension calls through a typed wrapper that disables
indirect-call CFI only at the cross-library call. Keep CFI enabled in
the callers and remove their file-level exemptions.

Use the generated Vulkan bindings for imported-fence calls.

Bug: 506004811
Change-Id: I7f9540a6d351051e31a87f3fa3aedbc5293f926f
---
